{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t\tTechnology\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology\/software' data-target='computer\/technology\/software' data-title='Software'>\r\n\t\t\tSoftware\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Semantic versioning MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH, +meta build metadata, and one GitHub tag with many named assets.","label":"Versioning","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/software\/developer","label":"Developer","url":"\/computer\/technology\/software\/developer"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/software\/windows_iso","label":"Windows ISO","url":"\/computer\/technology\/software\/windows_iso"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<div class='content-image-container'>\r\n\t<div class='cover-image cover-image-tile'>\r\n\t\t<img src='\/computer\/technology\/software\/versioning.svg' alt='Semantic versioning MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH, +meta build metadata, and one GitHub tag with many named assets.' style='object-fit: contain; object-position: center'>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p class='cover-credit'>\n\t<span class='cover-credit-anchor'>\n\t\t<button type='button' class='cover-credit-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-label='Image credit'>\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' width='14' height='14' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='8' r='6.25' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='5.2' r='0.85' fill='currentColor'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/simple-icons\/simple-icons\/blob\/15.0.0\/icons\/git.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simple Icons contributors<\/a> \/ <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/simple-icons\/simple-icons\/blob\/15.0.0\/icons\/git.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simple Icons<\/a> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Semantic versioning MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH, +meta build metadata, and one GitHub tag with many named assets.<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/dev.to\/saurabhdaware\/but-what-the-hell-is-package-lock-json-b04\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Semantic versioning<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMajor . Minor . Bugs \/ Iteration\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Bugs \u2014 no features added or removed<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Minor \u2014 backward compatible within the same major version<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Major \u2014 backward incompatible<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h2>Notes (concise)<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAI generated.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Core<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFormat: <code class='inline'>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH<\/code>\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>MAJOR \u2192 breaking<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>MINOR \u2192 backward-compatible feature<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>PATCH \u2192 backward-compatible fix<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h4>Non-code changes<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDocs\/README only \u2192 no version bump.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSame version can have multiple builds.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Build metadata<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSyntax: <code class='inline'>1.2.3+meta<\/code>\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tExamples:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>0.8.7+docs.1<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>0.8.7+keyboard-svg.1<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRules:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>ignored for precedence (treated same as <code class='inline'>1.2.3<\/code>)<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>allowed chars: <code class='inline'>[0-9A-Za-z-]<\/code>, use <code class='inline'>.<\/code> separator<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h4>Pre-release (if needed)<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>1.2.3-beta.1<\/code> (affects ordering)\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>4th number<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>1.2.3.4<\/code> \u2192 common but non-SemVer. Prefer <code class='inline'>+build<\/code> instead.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Releases vs builds<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDon't publish multiple \"releases\" with only <code class='inline'>+meta<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUse:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>single release: <code class='inline'>v0.8.7<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>artifacts with metadata<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h4>Rule of thumb<\/h4>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>behavior change \u2192 bump version<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>rebuild\/docs \u2192 metadata only<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaveat: some tooling ignores or strips <code class='inline'>+meta<\/code> entirely.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Keep the same tag<\/h2>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Keep tag\/release: <code class='inline'>v0.8.7<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Rename old artifact:<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<p>\n\t\t- <code class='inline'>app-0.8.7+original.zip<\/code> - or <code class='inline'>app-0.8.7+build.1.zip<\/code>\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Upload new artifact:<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<p>\n\t\t- <code class='inline'>app-0.8.7+docs.1.zip<\/code>\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Add release note:<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h4>Build artifacts<\/h4>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>app-0.8.7+build.1.zip<\/code> \u2014 original release artifact<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>app-0.8.7+docs.1.zip<\/code> \u2014 README\/docs update only; no code change<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf you already deleted the GitHub release asset, recover from:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>local build output<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>CI artifact history<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>GitHub Actions run artifacts<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>backup\/downloaded copy<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<p>\n\t\tBest rule: one tag, many named assets.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIndicate latest release artifact: use one tag + mark asset clearly.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInside GitHub release (<code class='inline'>v0.8.7<\/code>), name assets:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>app-0.8.7+build.1.zip<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>app-0.8.7+docs.1.zip<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>app-0.8.7-latest.zip<\/code> (alias)<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNo real alias in GitHub artifact, hence two options:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Upload a copy file \u2014 with <code class='inline'>latest<\/code> in the filename<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Indicate the latest filename in the release title<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/software\/versioning\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/software\/versioning\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/software\/developer' data-target='computer\/technology\/software\/developer' data-title='Developer' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Developer<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/software\/windows_iso' data-target='computer\/technology\/software\/windows_iso' data-title='Windows ISO' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Windows ISO<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/technology\/software' data-target='computer\/technology\/software' data-title='Software'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Software<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}